{"id":"75936","name":"辣白菜","author":"爽儿","authorId":"39717","desc":"","cover":"images/75936/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白菜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"苹果","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"白菜切成4份，用盐腌制12小时以上，并控水。","img":"images/75936/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"糯米粉加水熬成浆糊。","img":"images/75936/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"苹果、姜、蒜捣碎。","img":"images/75936/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"辣椒面内加入鱼露。","img":"images/75936/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加糖。","img":"images/75936/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加鸡精。","img":"images/75936/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加糯米糊和苹果糊混合。","img":"images/75936/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"把辣椒酱均匀的抹在白菜上。","img":"images/75936/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"室内发酵一天后放入冰箱。","img":"images/75936/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"腌制5天即可食用。","img":"images/75936/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}